{"id":"n72181-1-14","stage":1,"title":"태풍 · 台风","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72181-1-14-1","ko":"장마도 끝났는데 비가 일주일 내내 내리는군요.","zh":"雨季都结束了，怎么还会下整整一周的雨啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"장마도","meaning":"梅雨","explanation":"장마：梅雨；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"장마","audio":"/audio/450e1440e21148d42175.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71700","senseId":"1","lemma":"장마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝났는데","meaning":"结束，完","explanation":"끝나다：结束，完；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"2","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일주일","meaning":"一周，一星期","explanation":"일주일：一周，一星期","readings":[{"term":"일주일","audio":"/audio/d7137afeb52708a5fcb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30189","senseId":"1","lemma":"일주일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내내","meaning":"始终，一直","explanation":"내내：始终，一直","readings":[{"term":"내내","audio":"/audio/c4bb20b6c91a2fcfba30.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60627","senseId":"1","lemma":"내내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내리는군요.","meaning":"下，落","explanation":"내리다：下，落；는군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"내리다","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73353","senseId":"1","lemma":"내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"450e1440e21148d4","term":"장마","zh":"梅雨","audio":"/audio/450e1440e21148d42175.mp3","entryId":"71700","definition":"夏季连续多日下雨的现象或天气；或指那样的雨。","pronunciation":["장마"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"结束，完","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"规定的时间全都过去。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"d7137afeb52708a5","term":"일주일","zh":"一周，一星期","audio":"/audio/d7137afeb52708a5fcb9.mp3","entryId":"30189","definition":"从周一开始到周日的七天；或指一周。","pronunciation":["일쭈일"]},{"id":"c4bb20b6c91a2fcf","term":"내내","zh":"始终，一直","audio":"/audio/c4bb20b6c91a2fcfba30.mp3","entryId":"60627","definition":"从开始到最后持续着。","pronunciation":["내ː내"]},{"id":"01d776172b3f93c3","term":"내리다","zh":"下，落","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3","entryId":"73353","definition":"雪或雨等降下。","pronunciation":["내리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/97a50fa7c3320dc94697.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72181-1-14-2","ko":"태풍의 영향으로 당분간은 계속 비가 내릴 거랍니다.","zh":"据说因为台风的影响，接下来一段时间内还会一直下雨呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"태풍의","meaning":"台风","explanation":"태풍：台风；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"태풍","audio":"/audio/1d1d0a3fd2bb06745f7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72181","senseId":"1","lemma":"태풍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영향으로","meaning":"影响","explanation":"영향：影响；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"영향","audio":"/audio/5528424f5f612845dbac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14102","senseId":"1","lemma":"영향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"당분간은","meaning":"暂时，暂且","explanation":"당분간：暂时，暂且；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"당분간","audio":"/audio/8c78f09dbd688b308699.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14254","senseId":"1","lemma":"당분간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내릴","meaning":"下，落","explanation":"내리다：下，落；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"내리다","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73353","senseId":"1","lemma":"내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거랍니다.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；랍니다：礼貌地告知自己知道或听说的事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1d1d0a3fd2bb0674","term":"태풍","zh":"台风","audio":"/audio/1d1d0a3fd2bb06745f7b.mp3","entryId":"72181","definition":"主要指在7~9月，从太平洋刮到韩国、日本等亚洲大陆东部地区的伴随暴雨的狂风。","pronunciation":["태풍"]},{"id":"5528424f5f612845","term":"영향","zh":"影响","audio":"/audio/5528424f5f612845dbac.mp3","entryId":"14102","definition":"某个事情的效果或作用涉及到其他事情的行为。","pronunciation":["영ː향"]},{"id":"8c78f09dbd688b30","term":"당분간","zh":"暂时，暂且","audio":"/audio/8c78f09dbd688b308699.mp3","entryId":"14254","definition":"今后一段时间。","pronunciation":["당분간"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"01d776172b3f93c3","term":"내리다","zh":"下，落","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3","entryId":"73353","definition":"雪或雨等降下。","pronunciation":["내리다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/032681f507e184e09996.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.862,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72181","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"http